	(text "Annunciator drivers: TI TLC5927IDWR, not DM13A (v1 schematic said DM13A). Chains as v1: ANN_LOWER\nD22/23/24 -> U501 white -> U502 blue; ANN_UPPER D25/26/27 -> U503 amber -> U504 green/amber.\nOutputs named after their LED, from the as-built copper. LED anodes on +5V_LED, cathodes to the\noutputs, through the ribbons. 44 x 19 mA = 0.85 A in a light test on +5V_LED."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
